 ve public services through AI\, especially for underserved communities. FO
 CUS AREAS: public health\, economic mobility\, environmental resilience an
 d civic engagement (projects on voting or elections are excluded).\n\nOrga
 nisation: The Rockefeller Foundation and OpenAI Foundation\, managed by RF
  Catalytic Capital (RFCC)\nLocation: Global call: cities in all regions ar
 e eligible. Organisations headquartered\, registered or operating in a cou
